### ============================================================
### Event-Driven E-Commerce API — Local Test Requests
### ============================================================
### Usage: Open in VS Code with REST Client extension, or
###        use the built-in HTTP client in Visual Studio / Rider
###
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000 (dotnet run)
###           http://localhost:8080 (docker compose)
###
### Run requests in order: Register → Login → (copy token) → Test
### ============================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@contentType = application/json

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. HEALTH CHECKS
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Full health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

###

### Liveness probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/live

###

### Readiness probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/health/ready

###

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTHENTICATION
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Register a new user
# @name register
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "Ali",
  "lastName": "Gohar",
  "email": "ali@ecommerce.dev",
  "password": "StrongPass123!"
}

###

### Login
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "ali@ecommerce.dev",
  "password": "StrongPass123!"
}

###

### !! COPY the accessToken from the login response above !!
### Then paste it below replacing YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

###

### Get current user profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. CATEGORIES
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Create a category
# @name createCategory
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Electronics",
  "description": "Electronic devices and accessories"
}

###

### List all categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. PRODUCTS
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### !! Set your categoryId from the createCategory response above !!
@categoryId = YOUR_CATEGORY_ID_HERE

### Create a product
# @name createProduct
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Wireless Headphones Pro",
  "description": "Premium noise-cancelling wireless headphones",
  "price": 299.99,
  "sku": "WHP-001",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}"
}

###

### List products (with search & pagination)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Search products by name
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products?search=headphones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### !! Set productId from the createProduct response above !!
@productId = YOUR_PRODUCT_ID_HERE

### Get product by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. INVENTORY
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Adjust inventory (add 100 units)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory/{{productId}}/adjust
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "quantity": 100,
  "reason": "Initial stock"
}

###

### Get inventory status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/inventory/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. CART
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Add item to cart
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart/items
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 2
}

###

### View cart
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/cart
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 7. ORDERS
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Place an order
# @name placeOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "shippingAddress": {
    "street": "123 Main Street",
    "city": "Lahore",
    "state": "Punjab",
    "country": "Pakistan",
    "postalCode": "54000"
  }
}

###

### List my orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### !! Set orderId from the placeOrder response above !!
@orderId = YOUR_ORDER_ID_HERE

### Get order details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 8. PAYMENTS
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Process payment for the order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "orderId": "{{orderId}}",
  "amount": 599.98,
  "currency": "USD",
  "idempotencyKey": "PAY-{{orderId}}-001"
}

###

### Get payment status
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/payments/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ---------------------------------------------------------------
### 9. NOTIFICATIONS
### ---------------------------------------------------------------

### Get my notifications
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
